    "title": "The CW",
    "description": "Stream all the latest episodes from The CW, plus movies, sports, and full series! Keep up with new episodes of All American and Walker, stream hit series like Wild Cards, Grimm, Party of Five and Marvel\u2019s Runaways, or find your new favorite film in our fast-growing movie collection. If sports are your game, stream every LIV Golf tournament live and catch up on the latest football action with Inside the NFL. Can\u2019t decide what to watch? Lean back and enjoy our CHANNELS experience, hours and hours of entertainment, from comedies and thrillers to crime procedurals, cooking shows, and more, all streaming 24/7.\r\n\r\nFeatures Include:\r\nLATEST EPISODES: Watch new episodes of primetime shows the day after broadcast.\r\nFULL SERIES: Binge CW favorites like Girlfriends, Reign and The Carrie Diaries, or discover new obsessions like The Gifted, Harrow, The Bernie Mac Show and Star.\r\nMOVIES: New films are being added all the time.\r\nCW SPORTS: All LIV Golf tournaments are live and on demand, plus Emmy\u00ae Award-winning series Inside the NFL and original series like 100 Days To Indy.\r\nNO HASSLE: No cable subscription, no credit cards, no passwords.\r\nCHANNELS: Stream 24/7 programming, there\u2019s something for everyone.\r\n\r\nPlease note: This app features Nielsen\u2019s proprietary measurement software which will allow you to contribute to market research, like Nielsen\u2019s TV Ratings. Please visit http://www.nielsen.com/digitalprivacy for more information.\r\n\r\nAd Choices: https://www.cwtv.com/thecw/privacy-policy/#advertising\r\nTerms of Use: http://www.cwtv.com/thecw/terms-of-use/\r\nDo Not Sell My Personal Information: https://privacycenter.cwtv.com/",
